mized":null,"node_id":"IC_kwDOCTkjjc5L2CJb","performed_via_github_app":null,"pin":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/1272455771/reactions"},"updated_at":"2022-10-09T04:57:44Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/1272455771","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9633?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dlwh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dlwh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dlwh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dlwh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dlwh","id":9633,"login":"dlwh","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk2MzM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dlwh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dlwh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dlwh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dlwh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dlwh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dlwh","user_view_type":"public"}}],"issue":{"active_lock_reason":null,"assignee":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14262417?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yashk2810","id":14262417,"login":"yashk2810","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MjYyNDE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810","user_view_type":"public"},"assignees":[{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14262417?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yashk2810","id":14262417,"login":"yashk2810","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MjYyNDE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810","user_view_type":"public"}],"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","body":"### Description\r\n\r\nWhen using GDA, if you have a case where one of your mesh axes is of size 1, the GDA output by pjit will sometimes ignore the provided pspec and just return a prefix pspec that doesn't include the size=1 mesh axis.\r\n\r\nIn particular, for an output with shape `(128, 128)` partitioned according to `('data', 'model')`, then *if the model axis is size 1*, it will return one that it says is partitioned according to `('data',)`. This is all well and good except if you continue to pass in pspecs to pjit, as below. This behavior makes it harder to develop code that works for cases where the model axis is size 1 vs not size 1 (and where you're evolving your code base from pre-GDA to GDA)\r\n\r\n(Should I just be using jax.Array? they seemed even more experimental than GDAs)\r\n\r\n(Run with `XLA_FLAGS=--xla_force_host_platform_device_count=8`, or adjust to suit)\r\n```python\r\nimport jax\r\nfrom jax.experimental.global_device_array import GlobalDeviceArray\r\nfrom jax.random import PRNGKey\r\nimport jax.random as jrandom\r\nfrom jax.experimental.pjit import pjit\r\nfrom jax.interpreters.pxla import Mesh, PartitionSpec\r\nimport numpy as np\r\n\r\njax.config.update(\"jax_parallel_functions_output_gda\", True)\r\n\r\n# OK:\r\n# mesh_shape (4, 2)\r\nmesh_shape = (8, 1)\r\n\r\ndevices = jax.devices()\r\n\r\nmesh = Mesh(np.array(devices).reshape(mesh_shape), ('data', 'model'))\r\n\r\nkey = PRNGKey(0)\r\n\r\nwith mesh:\r\n    def f():\r\n        return jrandom.normal(key, (128, 128))\r\n    # GDA tupleizes the args here, which is fine\r\n    desired_pspec = PartitionSpec( ('data', ),('model', ))\r\n\r\n    f_pjit = pjit(f, in_axis_resources=None, out_axis_resources=desired_pspec)\r\n\r\n    out: GlobalDeviceArray = f_pjit()\r\n    assert out.shape == (128, 128)\r\n    # BOOM\r\n    assert out.mesh_axes == desired_pspec, f\"{out.mesh_axes} != {desired_pspec}\"\r\n\r\n    def g(a):\r\n        return a + a\r\n\r\n    g_pjit = pjit(g, in_axis_resources=desired_pspec, out_axis_resources=desired_pspec)\r\n\r\n    # also BOOM!\r\n    out2: GlobalDeviceArray = g_pjit(out)\r\n    # ValueError: Got an input GDA to pjit with different partitioning than specified in the in_axis_resources argument to pjit. The partitioning must match, or use `jax.experimental.pjit.FROM_GDA` in `in_axis_resources` for GDA. Got GDA sharding: MeshPspecSharding(mesh={'data': 8, 'model': 1}, partition_spec=PartitionSpec(('data',),)) and pjit sharding: MeshPspecSharding(mesh={'data': 8, 'model': 1}, partition_spec=PartitionSpec(('data',), ('model',)))\r\n```\r\n\r\n### What jax/jaxlib version are you using?\r\n\r\n3.17, also main as of today 2022-10-07\r\n\r\n### Which accelerator(s) are you using?\r\n\r\nCPU, TPU\r\n\r\n### Additional system info\r\n\r\n_No response_\r\n\r\n### NVIDIA GPU info\r\n\r\n_No response_","closed_at":"2022-10-09T04:57:44Z","closed_by":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9633?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dlwh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dlwh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dlwh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dlwh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dlwh","id":9633,"login":"dlwh","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk2MzM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dlwh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dlwh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dlwh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dlwh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dlwh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dlwh","user_view_type":"public"},"comments":4,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/12702/comments","created_at":"2022-10-07T19:25:37Z","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/12702/events","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/12702","id":1401586011,"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"total_blocking":0},"issue_field_values":[],"labels":[{"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null,"color":"d73a4a","default":true,"description":"Something isn't working","id":1104782284,"name":"bug","node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMTA0NzgyMjg0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/labels/bug"}],"labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/12702/labels{/name}","locked":false,"milestone":null,"node_id":"I_kwDOCTkjjc5TioFb","number":12702,"performed_via_github_app":null,"pinned_comment":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0